<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Your custom CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
<div class="container"> 
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>

<h1 class="text-center mb-5">About Me</h1>

<div class="row">

    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title">Who I Am</h2>
                <p class="card-text">
                    My name is Mustafa Omar, and I am a student at
                    Ontario Tech University studying Networking and
                    IT Security. I am interested in technology,
                    networking, and cybersecurity and enjoy
                    developing my technical skills.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title">My Education and Interests</h2>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Through my studies, I am learning about computer
                    networks, information security, and other areas
                    of information technology. I am particularly
                    interested in networking, cybersecurity, and
                    cloud computing.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title">My Career Goals</h2>
                <p class="card-text">
                    My goal is to build a successful career in the
                    technology industry. I hope to work for a leading
                    technology company such as Cisco and continue
                    developing my skills through hands-on experience
                    and professional certifications, including
                    Microsoft Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900).
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    </div>
</body>
</html>